    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Grow Your Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farming journey begins with seeds and soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the land, plant seeds, water the crops, and watch your produce grow over time. Use your tools to keep everything healthy and efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/153fb686d2a11adb7c660182bd7a69cb.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/153fb686d2a11adb7c660182bd7a69cb.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/153fb686d2a11adb7c660182bd7a69cb.mp4?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Planting, watering, and harvesting your own fresh produce.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc04 Raise Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm is home to chickens, cows, and sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, care for them, and collect fresh eggs, milk, and wool. Animals bring life to your farm and valuable resources to your market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/66c67f1646eb7ba2afb08f4660fc708f.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/66c67f1646eb7ba2afb08f4660fc708f.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take care of your chickens, cows, and sheep to produce fresh goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddfa Stock the Shelves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After harvesting, organize your products and place them on market shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide what to sell and how to display it \u2014 keep your shop clean, full, and attractive to draw in customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/37120f01504056e36a9e5042e35d9e01.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/37120f01504056e36a9e5042e35d9e01.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restock your shelves with fresh produce and handmade goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Serve Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your market gets busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers wait in line, ready to buy. Scan their items, pack their bags, and make sure they leave happy. A fast checkout makes them love your store even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/dc57db8756ef5768b7f49dcfbd6cc744.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/dc57db8756ef5768b7f49dcfbd6cc744.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customers line up and you manage the checkout process.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb5 Handle Payments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the cashier, you\u2019ll collect money and give change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes sharp and hands quick \u2014 manage every sale and earn money to grow your market even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/bdd7188589e4b986f406b2633f374506.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/bdd7188589e4b986f406b2633f374506.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Receive payments and give correct change at the register.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Grow Your Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farming journey begins with seeds and soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow the land, plant seeds, water the crops, and watch your produce grow over time. Use your tools to keep everything healthy and efficient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/153fb686d2a11adb7c660182bd7a69cb.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/153fb686d2a11adb7c660182bd7a69cb.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/153fb686d2a11adb7c660182bd7a69cb.mp4?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Planting, watering, and harvesting your own fresh produce.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc04 Raise Animals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your farm is home to chickens, cows, and sheep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed them, care for them, and collect fresh eggs, milk, and wool. Animals bring life to your farm and valuable resources to your market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/66c67f1646eb7ba2afb08f4660fc708f.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/66c67f1646eb7ba2afb08f4660fc708f.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Take care of your chickens, cows, and sheep to produce fresh goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddfa Stock the Shelves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After harvesting, organize your products and place them on market shelves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide what to sell and how to display it \u2014 keep your shop clean, full, and attractive to draw in customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/37120f01504056e36a9e5042e35d9e01.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/37120f01504056e36a9e5042e35d9e01.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Restock your shelves with fresh produce and handmade goods.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddcd\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Serve Your Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your market gets busy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers wait in line, ready to buy. Scan their items, pack their bags, and make sure they leave happy. A fast checkout makes them love your store even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/dc57db8756ef5768b7f49dcfbd6cc744.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/dc57db8756ef5768b7f49dcfbd6cc744.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Customers line up and you manage the checkout process.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcb5 Handle Payments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the cashier, you\u2019ll collect money and give change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes sharp and hands quick \u2014 manage every sale and earn money to grow your market even more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/bdd7188589e4b986f406b2633f374506.poster.avif?t=1750336994\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434210/extras/bdd7188589e4b986f406b2633f374506.webm?t=1750336994\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Receive payments and give correct change at the register.</i></p>",
